          "settings": {
            "heading": "<strong>Are you ready to adopt?</strong>",
            "heading_size": "h0"
          }
        },
        "text_h7WDKK": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Every kitty in our care is looking for more than just a home—they're looking for their forever family.</strong> Each of our cats and kittens has been rescued, cared for, and prepared for the next chapter of their lives. Now, they're ready to find the people who will love them for a lifetime.</p><p>If you're interested in adopting, please complete an adoption application before contacting us. Once we receive your application, a member of our team will review it and reach out to you within <strong>24–48 hours</strong>.</p><p>Please keep in mind that <strong>Lucky Penny Kitties is a foster-based rescue</strong>, not a traditional shelter. Our cats live in loving foster homes throughout the community, so they may not be available to go home the same day. We appreciate your patience as we work with our fosters to schedule meet-and-greets and ensure the best possible match for both you and your new furry family member.</p><p><strong>Thank you for choosing adoption and giving a rescue cat the second chance they deserve.</strong> 🩷🐾</p>"
          }
        },
